      <p>{"{"}% include "./_attributes/common-attributes.md" %{"}"} Cluster administrators</p>
      <p>and Operator catalog maintainers can create and manage custom catalogs packaged using the bundle format on Operator Lifecycle Manager (OLM) in OpenShift Container Platform.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
